<%# A séance as a card on a phone and a row from 1024 px (Service page; milestone 2 reuses it).
    Its number and outcome come first, as on the old tables. An Absence or a -24h séance gets a
    coloured stripe and tint, so it stands out in the list.
    « Modifier » and « Supprimer » show when the policy allows; they work in the
    card's Turbo frame (sessions/_card_frame).
    Locals: session, number (its number in the service, FliipService#numbered_sessions). %>
<article class="card seance-card seance-card--session seance-card--<%= session.outcome %>">
  <div class="seance-card__tag">
    <span class="seance-card__title">Séance #<%= format_count(number) %></span>
    <%# Présent·e for a charged séance; Absence or -24h say the client was absent. %>
    <span class="badge <%= outcome_badge_class(session) %>"><%= session.present ? "Présent·e" : session.outcome_label %></span>
  </div>
  <div class="seance-card__main">
    <div class="seance-card__when numeric">
      <%= seance_datetime(session.occurred_at) %> · <%= session.duration_short %>
    </div>
    <div class="text-muted text-small numeric">créée : <%= session.created_at.strftime("%d/%m/%Y %H:%M") %></div>
    <%# « Non confirmée » until payroll, then « Confirmée le … » in the same place. %>
    <div class="seance-card__status text-small"><%= confirmation_status(session) %></div>
  </div>
  <div class="seance-card__people text-small">
    <span>Entraîneur·e : <%= session.user&.full_name.presence || "—" %></span>
    <% if session.created_by_id != session.user_id %>
      <span class="text-muted">Saisie par <%= session.created_by&.full_name.presence || "—" %></span>
    <% end %>
  </div>
  <%= render "sessions/card_actions", session: session, stacked: true %>
</article>
